    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terra Avoider is a 2.5D shooter in which the player must survive through difficult, arena based boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has a number of tools at their disposal to inflict destruction on the invaders and to avoid annihilation at their hands, or whatever they have in place of hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge - Increases speed and become immune for a split second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Dilation - Slows down the passage of time for a brief period.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recharging shield - Absorbs a hit, causing the player to become immune for a couple of seconds afterwards. This also adds a multiplier to the speed of your weapon up to 5 times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Overheat Venting (Active reload) - Successful 'reloads' release a powerful plasma orb, whilst also adding 1/5th of a charge towards the player's shield This also increases the ship's rate of fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard mode and level select - Unlocked after game completion.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable key bindings and sound mixer.</p></li></ul>",
